 "body": "I tried to make a RS485 bridge and i use Serial.flush() to wait for the serial transmission is complete.\nbut it turned out that this never happened.\nI used this sketch.\nYou need a oscilloscope, to measure pin 2 to verify it.\n\nvoid setup()\n{\n  Serial.begin(38400);\n  Serial1.begin(38400);\n  pinMode(2, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop()\n{\n  if(Serial.available())\n  {  \n      digitalWrite(2, HIGH);\n      Serial1.write(Serial.read());\n      Serial1.flush();\n      digitalWrite(2, LOW);\n  }\n\n  if(Serial1.available())Serial.write(Serial1.read());\n}\n",
